{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1197390-\u200bnephandus-demon-mage","id":1197390,"title":"\u200bNephandus - Demon-mage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-19T16:50:00-07:00","id":1197390,"title":"\u200bNephandus - Demon-mage","content":"How long can a Nephandus live?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23826-karrgoot","name":"Karrgoot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T17:26:41-07:00","id":1197397,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karrgoot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1197390-\u200bnephandus-demon-mage#post1197390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How long can a Nephandus live?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 5 days. Of course, such a thing doesn't really mean anything unless you clarify further.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T17:44:51-07:00","id":1197405,"title":"","content":"\u201cDemon-mage\u201d makes me think you\u2019re talking about Nephandi from Ascension, the mages with an Inverted Avatar, rather than Nefandi from Awakening, mages who practice Left-Handed magic. If that\u2019s the case, wrong forum. If that\u2019s not the case, well, as Vent0 says it\u2019s hard to pin down. I suppose Liches live longer by definition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-20T09:00:15-07:00","id":1197627,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1197390-\u200bnephandus-demon-mage?p=1197397#post1197397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> 5 days. Of course, such a thing doesn't really mean anything unless you clarify further.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>In Constantinople by night there is a Nephandus - Demon-mage LAYLA MADEER.</b></span></span> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> The enigmatic owner of the House of Lamps is a mage who has lived beyond her years through loyal service to the Decani, an order of 36 demons of disease. Born in Alexandria, Layla was the wife of an Egyptian trader named Jiy\u2019al who brought grains to Constantinople for trade. Having made several allies within the city, Layla\u2019s husband moved to the capital to open shop as a grain merchant. He promised that he would send for his wife later.<br /> <br /> When Jiy\u2019al vanished and his brother sought to learn his fate, Layla managed to convince her brother-in-law to take her along. After several months in Constantinople, the two discovered that Jiy\u2019al had become a slave to his own vices and was now a thrall to people he called Setites. When Jiy\u2019al revealed his fate, Setites ambushed the three and the two brothers died. Layla\u2019s saving grace was the awakening of her Avatar, and the glowing corona of light that surrounded her. Though the display of power was minor, it was enough to send the frightened Setites scrambling and gave her the chance to escape into the night.<br /> <br /> Spending her next few days hidden, Layla eventually came upon the House of Lamps and felt a power beckoning from within. That\u2019s when she met Azzatti, a mage like herself and owner of the shop. He introduced her to her Awakened nature and to his dark masters. Ever since then, Layla has lived in the House of Lamps as a Nephandus \u2014 a demon-mage. <br /> <br /> When Azzatti died, Layla became owner of the shop and has defended it well. She is currently 140 years old and the fifth Nephandus to take ownership of the store. The House of Lamps is important because a Node lies beneath it \u2014 a source of power for magi \u2014 and the place is a Nephandus portal to the spirit realm.<br /> <br /> Layla has recently taken in the Baali known as Mary the Black, and is using her in an attempt to learn more about Cainites. Mary, however, is proving to be a powerful individual, and is enrapturing Layla with her own dark nature.</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Now i am GM, and my players are going to play this campain from 365 ish and not from 1197. so i need to place this five nephandus in the time line i have constructed. </b></span><b>Now How long can a Nephandus live?</b></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23826-karrgoot","name":"Karrgoot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-20T09:02:28-07:00","id":1197628,"title":"","content":"Yeah, wrong game. You want the Mage: The Ascension forum","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join D